+
+To generate the readme and API documentation with [verb](https://github.com/verbose/verb):
+
+```sh
+$ npm install -g verb verb-generate-readme && verb
+```
+
+### Running tests
+
+Install dev dependencies:
+
+```sh
+$ npm install -d && npm test
+```
+
+### Author
